  "question": "Where can I find a zoo inside a 50 kilometers radius toward the east of Marietta Gone with the Wind Museum, Marietta, GA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-84.552262 33.943822)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-84.552262 33.943822)',4326)::geography, 50000)\nAND tourism = 'zoo'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
